on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  5] extcall 1 ............................... <soundBusy(1)>
  [  7] jmpifz [ 18] ............................ if soundBusy(1) then
  [ 10] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 12] thebuiltin 2 ............................ <the frame>
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 16] extcall 3 ............................... go(the frame)
  [ 18] ret
end
